## Implementation notes


Deviations from the Phase 4 plans, as implemented:

- **MotionPolicy / MotionMode** live in `contracts/ir.ts` (wire types) and
  `packages/runtime/src/motion.ts` (policy implementation) rather than the
  locations sketched in the P1 plan.
- **P15 smoothing** is applied inside `InteractionManager` via the
  `trackSmoothing` option (wired from `IRTrack.smoothing` at boot), not as a
  separate scene-layer pass.
- **P13 window-hi** DPR selection takes the *last* match of the top dpr
  group (documented in `packages/rendering/src/quality.ts`).
- **P17 poster removal** matches draw-list `nodeId`s: only posters of nodes
  that produced a draw call on the first frame are removed; posters of
  hidden/unmounted nodes are kept.
- **P17+P8 boot-level tests omitted** — parse-level coverage only
  (`packages/runtime/test/skew.test.mjs`,
  `packages/codegen/test/poster.test.mjs`). The runtime package has no DOM
  harness, so the bootEngine skeleton-preservation path and the
